<!-- Cloud Socks · "¿Son para vos?" · Para pegar en un bloque "Liquid personalizado" -->
<style>
  #cs-benef { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 0 16px; text-align: center;
    color: #1B2A4A; font-family: inherit; }
  #cs-benef .cs-wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
  #cs-benef .cs-titulo { font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit); font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight, 600);
    font-size: clamp(26px, 6.5vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin: 0; color: inherit; }
  #cs-benef .cs-sub { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 0; opacity: .7; }
  #cs-benef .cs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  #cs-benef .cs-card { margin: 0; background: #1B2A4A; color: #F5F1E8; border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px; padding: 18px 8px; min-height: 128px; }
  #cs-benef .cs-icono { width: 32px; height: 32px; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: .95; }
  #cs-benef .cs-icono svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;
    fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  #cs-benef .cs-card p { margin: 0; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: .01em; text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  @media screen and (max-width: 340px) {
    #cs-benef .cs-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #cs-benef { padding: 0 24px; }
    #cs-benef .cs-sub { font-size: 17px; margin-top: 10px; }
    #cs-benef .cs-grid { gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
    #cs-benef .cs-card { border-radius: 22px; min-height: 190px; padding: 32px 28px; gap: 18px;
      transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease; }
    #cs-benef .cs-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(27,42,74,.18); }
    #cs-benef .cs-icono { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
    #cs-benef .cs-icono svg { stroke-width: 1.5; }
    #cs-benef .cs-card p { font-size: 17px; }
  }
</style>

<div id="cs-benef">
  <div class="cs-wrap">
    <h2 class="cs-titulo">¿Son para vos?</h2>
    <p class="cs-sub">Cloud Socks son ideales si querés:</p>

    <ul class="cs-grid" role="list">
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 8h48M8 8l4-3.5M8 8l4 3.5M56 8l-4-3.5M56 8l-4 3.5"/><path d="M26 60c-6 0-8.5-7-8-14.5.4-7 2.5-10.5 2.5-15 0-3.5 2.5-5.5 6-5.5h11c4.5 0 7 2.5 7 7 0 5 2 9.5 2 16.5 0 7.5-4 11.5-10 11.5z"/><circle cx="41" cy="19" r="4.6"/><circle cx="31" cy="17.5" r="3.3"/><circle cx="23.5" cy="19.5" r="2.9"/><circle cx="17" cy="23.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="29" r="2.1"/></svg></div>
        <p>Que tus dedos no se aprieten más</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g transform="rotate(45 32 32)"><rect x="11" y="25" width="42" height="14" rx="7"/><path d="M25 25v14M39 25v14"/></g><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27"/><path d="M13 51L51 13"/></svg></div>
        <p>Chau ampollas y dolor de pies</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M24 10s-13 16-13 26a13 13 0 0 0 26 0c0-10-13-26-13-26z"/><path d="M18 37a6 6 0 0 0 6 6"/><path d="M42 22h11a4 4 0 1 0-4-4M42 32h16M42 42h11a4 4 0 1 1-4 4"/></svg></div>
        <p>Pies secos y frescos todo el día</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M23 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><path d="M32 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><path d="M41 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27"/><path d="M13 13l38 38"/></svg></div>
        <p>Olvidarte del mal olor</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19 47h27a10 10 0 0 0 1-20 14 14 0 0 0-27-3 11.5 11.5 0 0 0-1 23z"/></svg></div>
        <p>Sentir tus pies en una nube</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M32 7l18 7v15c0 13-8 22-18 27-10-5-18-14-18-27V14z"/><path d="M24 31l6 6 11-12"/></svg></div>
        <p>Talón y punta reforzados, para que duren</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
